          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"pricing02\" group=\"Pricing\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showmainButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Price\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentBg\" condition=\"bg.type === 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showmainButton\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>STOCK MARKET TRADING &amp; INVESTING COURSES</b></h4>\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n                    </h5>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center item-footer mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showmainButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get Started</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-561x396.webp\" alt>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>BASIC TECHNICAL ANALYSIS</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>₹</b> 14950</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Module 1: Introduction to Stock Market - </b>Overview of Indian stock market - History of Indian stock market - Types of stocks and exchanges (BSE, NSE, MCX) - Stock market indices (Sensex, Nifty, Nifty 50) \n<br><b>Module 2: Understanding Stocks - \n</b><br>What is a stock? - Types of stocks (equity, preference, dividend) - Stock pricing and valuation - Face value, market value, and book value \n<br><b>Module 3: Getting Started -</b> <br>Opening a demat and trading account - Understanding brokerage and commissions - Placing orders (buy, sell, limit, stop-loss) - Understanding margin and leverage\n<br><b>Module 4: Market Analysis -</b> Fundamental analysis (financial statements, ratios) - Technical analysis (charts, patterns, indicators) - News and market sentiment - Economic indicators (GDP, inflation, interest rates) \n<br><b>Module 5: Investment Options -</b> <br>Stocks (large-cap, mid-cap, small-cap) - Mutual funds (equity, debt, balanced) - Exchange-traded funds (ETFs) - Index funds - Sectoral funds \n<br><b>Module 6: Risk Management -</b> Understanding risk and reward - Diversification and asset allocation - Stop-loss and hedging strategies - Risk management techniques (insurance, derivatives)\n<br><b>Module 7: Market Trends and Indices</b>&nbsp;- Understanding bull and bear markets - Sensex and Nifty indices - Sectoral trends and analysis - Index funds and ETFs&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><b>Module 8: Company Analysis -</b> Financial statement analysis (balance sheet, income statement) - Ratio analysis (P/E, P/B, dividend yield) - Industry and market analysis - Company valuation methods \n<br><b>Module 9: Trading Strategies -</b> Day trading and swing trading - Long-term investing and value investing - News-based trading and event-driven trading - Technical analysis strategies \n<br><b>Module 10: Basic&nbsp; Options -</b> Options and futures trading - Futures and options strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 11: Portfolio Management -</b> Portfolio construction and management - Asset allocation and diversification - Performance measurement and evaluation - Portfolio rebalancing and optimization \n<br><b>Module 12: Advanced Topics -</b> Behavioral finance and psychology - Market sentiment and positioning - Advanced risk management techniques - Alternative investment options (real estate, commodities) This comprehensive course content covers all aspects of the Indian stock market, from basics to advanced topics, and provides a solid foundation for investors and traders to build upon.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/aRSG020bP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Enroll Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1920x1280.webp\" alt data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>OPTION BUYING AND MOMENTUM TRADING</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>₹</b> 18999</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Module 1: </b>Become an Option Buying &amp;\n<br>Momentum Trading Expert!<br><br>Learn How to HEDGE using Debit, Credit systems<br><br>Finish trade in 1st hour of market before 10:30 am \n<br><br>Trade with Low Risk and learn how to trail profits<br><br>&nbsp;Learn to Trade the last 1 hour of market (Closing Momentum Phase of 2-3pm)<br><br> \nExperience Level of Students – Beginner to Advanced<br><br>Learn how to select high-probability movement stocks<br><br>Deep Understanding of option CE or PE<br><br>Boost confidence to take option trade\n<br>\n<br>Join the top 1% of Option Buyers\n<br>\n<br>Build a strong trading foundation<br><br>Learn to Trade both WEEKLY and MONTHLY OPTIONS<br><br>Learn about concepts like SHORT COVERING, Long/Short Buildup in Options<br> \n<br><b>Module : Risk Management -</b> Understanding risk and reward - Diversification and asset allocation - Stop-loss and hedging strategies - Risk management techniques (insurance, derivatives)<br>\n<br><br><br><br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/aRSG020bP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Enroll Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-561x374.webp\" alt data-slide-to=\"2\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>INTERMEDIATE TECHNICAL ANALYSIS</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>₹</b> 34989</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Module 1: Advanced Stock Market Concepts -</b><br>Market capitalization and liquidity - Market efficiency and randomness - Risk and return analysis&nbsp;<br><b>Module 2: Technical Analysis -</b> Chart patterns (candlesticks, trends) - Technical indicators (MA, RSI, Bollinger Bands) - Elliot Wave theory and Fibonacci retracement&nbsp;<br><b>Module 3: Fundamental Analysis -</b> <br>Financial statement analysis (balance sheet, income statement) - Ratio analysis (P/E, P/B, dividend yield) - Industry and market analysis&nbsp;<br><b>Module 4: Portfolio Management -</b> Portfolio construction and management - Asset allocation and diversification - Performance measurement and evaluation<br><b>Module 5: Options and Futures -</b> Introduction to options and futures - Options strategies (buy, sell, spread) - Futures strategies (long, short, spread)<br><b>Module 6: Risk Management -</b> Understanding risk and reward - Diversification and asset allocation - Stop-loss and hedging strategies<br><b>Module 7: Sectoral Analysis -</b> Understanding sectoral trends - Analyzing sectoral performance - Sectoral rotation and its impact&nbsp;<br><b>Module 8: Company Valuation -</b> Methods of company valuation (DCF, P/E, P/B) - Valuation ratios and their interpretation - Company valuation case studies \n<br>ES.<br><b>Module 9: Market Sentiment and Positioning -</b> Understanding market sentiment - Analyzing market positioning - Using sentiment and positioning in trading decisions&nbsp;<br><b>Module 10: Advanced Trading Strategies -</b> Day trading and swing trading strategies - Long-term investing and value investing strategies - News-based trading and event-driven trading strategies This intermediate course content builds on the basics and provides a deeper understanding of the Indian stock market, technical and fundamental analysis, portfolio management, options and futures, risk management, sectoral analysis, company valuation, market sentiment, and advanced trading strategies.&nbsp;<br><b>Module 11: Advanced Topics -</b> Behavioral finance and psychology - Market sentiment and positioning - Advanced risk management techniques - Alternative investment options (real estate, commodities) This comprehensive course content covers all aspects of the Indian stock market, from basics to advanced topics, and provides a solid foundation for investors and traders to build upon<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/aRSG020bP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Enroll Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1-561x374.webp\" alt data-bs-slide-to=\"3\" data-slide-to=\"3\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>ADVANCE TECHNICAL ANALYSIS</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>₹</b> 54989</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Module 1: Advanced Technical Analysis -</b>&nbsp; Fibonacci retracement - Advanced chart patterns (Triangles, Wedges, Flags) - Technical indicators (MACD, Stochastic, Bollinger Bands)&nbsp;<br><b>Module 2: Advanced Fundamental Analysis -</b> Advanced financial statement analysis (Cash flow statements, ratio analysis) - Industry analysis and competitive analysis - Management analysis and corporate governance&nbsp;<br><b>Module 3: Options and Futures Strategies -</b> Advanced options strategies (Butterfly, Condor, Iron Condor) - Futures strategies (Calendar spreads, Inter-commodity spreads) - Options and futures combination strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 4: Risk Management and Hedging -</b> Advanced risk management techniques (Value at Risk, Stress testing) - Hedging strategies (Delta hedging, Gamma hedging) - Risk management using options and futures&nbsp;<br><b>Module 5: Portfolio Optimization -</b> Advanced portfolio optimization techniques (Black-Litterman model, Risk parity) - Portfolio rebalancing and tax optimization - Performance measurement and evaluation&nbsp;<br><b>Module 6: Advanced Sectoral Analysis -</b> Sectoral rotation and its impact - Sectoral analysis using fundamental and technical analysis - Sectoral investing strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 7: Company Valuation and Modelling -</b> Advanced company valuation methods (DCF, EVA) - Financial modelling using Excel - Company valuation case studies<br><b>Module 8: Market Sentiment and Positioning Analysis -</b> Advanced market sentiment analysis (Sentiment indices, Positioning indicators) - Market positioning analysis (CoT reports, Options data) - Using sentiment and positioning in trading decisions&nbsp;<br><b>Module 9: Advanced Trading Strategies -</b> Advanced day trading and swing trading strategies - Long-term investing and value investing strategies - News-based trading and event-driven trading strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 10: Quantitative Analysis and Algorithmic Trading -</b> Introduction to quantitative analysis and algorithmic trading - Using data analysis and back testing - Advanced quantitative strategies (Factor-based investing, Risk parity)&nbsp;<br><b>Module 11: Advanced Topics -</b> Behavioral finance and psychology - Market sentiment and positioning - Advanced risk management techniques - Alternative investment options (real estate, commodities) This comprehensive course content covers all aspects of the Indian stock market, from basics to advanced topics, and provides a solid foundation for investors and traders to build upon<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/aRSG020bP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Enroll Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
